Scenario illustrations

The scenario illustrations under assets/scenarios/ were generated with an AI image
tool (ChatGPT, by OpenAI) from prompts written for this game. They are not
hand-drawn and are not presented as such.

Any third-party art, sound or font added later is listed here and in the in-app
credits screen together with its license.

